cription": "Fixation identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within drift and effective population size. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. It appears before bottlenecks because that next topic assumes this starting point."}, {"id": "7a1d8da1-2a87-498d-bd07-515c2f944c05", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Bottlenecks", "children": [], "description": "Bottlenecks identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within drift and effective population size. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After fixation, bottlenecks supplies what is needed to address founder effects."}, {"id": "0922986c-8302-49f0-b68f-da91eb950769", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Founder effects", "children": [], "description": "Founder effects identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within drift and effective population size. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After bottlenecks, founder effects supplies what is needed to address coalescent intuition."}, {"id": "6db849dd-e1ed-4dfe-b03a-125f02ff8078", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Coalescent intuition", "children": [], "description": "Coalescent intuition identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within drift and effective population size. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, coalescent intuition carries the completed idea into gene flow and population structure."}]}, {"id": "7e93f407-0bbb-4d97-96fe-a232e2d93609", "type": "topic", "title": "Gene flow and population structure", "description": "This module builds directly on drift and effective population size and develops gene flow and population structure. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for quantitative traits.", "children": [{"id": "edc07607-28d4-4eb3-9d